<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zizhitongjian" book-id="b-zizhitongjian-102" chapter-id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou" source-id="s-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou">
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:linzhu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">前鋒<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:linzhu:m0002" ref="okp_6uz_rfi">鄧遐</persName>、<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:linzhu:m0005" ref="qad_k9o_71k">朱序</persName>敗燕將<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:linzhu:m0010" ref="wse_ygh_z6q">傅顏</persName>於林渚。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:meeting" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">辛丑，丞相<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:meeting:m0005" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAF">昱</persName>與大司馬<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:meeting:m0010" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>會塗中，以謀後舉；以<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:meeting:m0021" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>世子<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:meeting:m0024" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAA">熙</persName>為豫州刺史、假節。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:yuan" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">二月，癸酉，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:yuan:m0006" ref="2c9_218_9b3">袁真</persName>卒。陳郡太守<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:yuan:m0014" ref="rzi_blt_mvz">朱輔</persName>立<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:yuan:m0017" ref="2c9_218_9b3">真</persName>子<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:yuan:m0019" ref="5g8_38w_78i">瑾</persName>為建威將軍，豫州刺史，以保壽春</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:south" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">南頓太守<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:south:m0004" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_ACA">桓石虔</persName>克其南城。<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:south:m0012" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_ACA">石虔</persName>，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-102-jin098-huanwen-fangtou:south:m0015" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>之弟子也。</p>
</text>
